@verbatim
  ==============================================================================
                ##### LPTIM Start Stop operation functions #####
  ==============================================================================
    [..]  This section provides functions allowing to:
      (+) Start the PWM mode.
      (+) Stop the PWM mode.
      (+) Start the One pulse mode.
      (+) Stop the One pulse mode.
      (+) Start the Set once mode.
      (+) Stop the Set once mode.
      (+) Start the Encoder mode.
